<title>UK: GSI sets call warrants on CS Group.</title>
<headline>GSI sets call warrants on CS Group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs International has issued four million American-style call warrants on registered shares of CS Group, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Bank said.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by five warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    170 CHF		   PREMIUM	11.08 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.10 CHF		  GEARING	10.77 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.APR.97-17.JUL.98   PAYDATE	02.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     MIN EXER LOT 500</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  167 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
